# Brody, The Lone Star

> Brody is the marksman you draft when every basic attack has to land harder than the other guy's, not faster. He trades attack speed for the heaviest per-hit number in the role, a ramping passive that rewards staying on a single target, and an ultimate that detonates harder the lower your enemies' health drops. No crit scaling, one stun, zero room for error.

