## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-07. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Default (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Brute Force Breastplate, Immortality
- Core: Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against two or more physical divers who can reach you through your frontline.; Sea Halberd over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when the enemy has a healer or shield support keeping the first target alive.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst that kills you before Immortality revives.
- Total cost: 12100 gold

Balanced gold lane setup. Brute Force Breastplate covers the survivability gap while its Adaptive Attack stacks compound with Brody's mark-accumulated auto sequence. Immortality is the standard late-game closer.

### Maximum Burst (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Endless Battle, Blade of the Heptaseas, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Hunter Strike
- Core: Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Brute Force Breastplate over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when the enemy has an assassin or burst mage that can reach you before you finish the carry.; Immortality over Hunter Strike when Use in the very late game when a single death decides the match.; Sea Halberd over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when a healer, shield support, or high-HP fighter is preventing marks from sticking.
- Total cost: 12070 gold

Full-damage setup for games where you have double frontline peel and can afford to skip defense. Heptaseas' Ambush passive resets between mark-stacking sequences. Malefic Gun extends your range and adds flat penetration.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Gold)

- Items: Tough Boots, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar, Wind of Nature, Rose Gold Meteor
- Core: Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Brute Force Breastplate over Wind of Nature when Use when the main threat is magic burst rather than physical dive.; Immortality over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when fights go past 15 minutes and the revive timer matters more than the Lifeline shield.; Swift Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy CC count is low enough to survive without the CC reduction.
- Total cost: 11830 gold

Defensive setup for CC-heavy or dive-heavy drafts where surviving the first lockout matters more than maximizing the sixth damage slot. Purify plus Tough Boots plus Wind Chant active gives three survival layers against chain-CC engage.

